# LF everywhere for text: the repo ships router-facing files (ucode, ash,
# Makefiles, LuCI JS) and byte-exact router captures (tests/fixtures*.out).
# A CRLF worktree (Windows core.autocrlf=true) breaks fixture assertions and
# would leak \r into APK-shipped ucode. Binary payloads are excluded.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bin binary
# Preserve the byte-identical upstream patch; its nested diff context contains
# intentional space-tab and blank context lines.
tests/native/core/fixtures/*.patch -whitespace
